{"id": "1910088", "name": "רציפות בשתי נקודות – שני פרמטרים", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: none; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q6_VISUAL_V7\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">רציפות בשתי נקודות – שני פרמטרים</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 12px;\">נתונה הפונקציה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 2; overflow-x: visible;\">\\(\\displaystyle f\\left(x\\right)=\\begin{cases}{{CT:0}} &amp; x&lt;{{CT:1}}\\\\Ax+B &amp; {{CT:1}}\\leq x\\leq0\\\\{{CT:2}} &amp; x&gt;0\\end{cases}\\)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n<p>מצאו את הזוג \\(\\displaystyle [A,B]\\) שעבורו הפונקציה רציפה בנקודות \\(\\displaystyle x={{CT:1}}\\) ו־\\(\\displaystyle x=0\\). את התשובה הזינו כקבוצה המכילה זוג אחד.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.9;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\) [[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF; margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 8px; text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px;\"><strong>בדיקת ההקלדה</strong><br>[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q6_CONTINUITY_V4_CASES_LIMITINLINE\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n<p><strong>ב־\\(\\displaystyle x=0\\):</strong> לענף הימני יש צורה \\(\\displaystyle1^\\infty\\). שימוש בלוגריתם ובגבולות המופלאים נותן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.9; overflow-x: auto;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to0^+}{{CT:2}}={{CT:3}}\\)</div>\n<p>הענף האמצעי מקבל ב־\\(\\displaystyle0\\) את הערך \\(\\displaystyle B\\), ולכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.9; overflow-x: auto;\">\\(\\displaystyle B={{CT:3}}\\)</div>\n<p><strong>ב־\\(\\displaystyle x={{CT:1}}\\):</strong></p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.9; overflow-x: auto;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to{{CT:1}}^-}{{CT:0}}={{CT:4}}\\)</div>\n<p>ולכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.9; overflow-x: auto;\">\\(\\displaystyle A{{CT:1}}+{{CT:3}}={{CT:4}}\\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.9; overflow-x: auto;\">\\(\\displaystyle A={{CT:5}}\\)</div>\n<p>מכאן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.9; overflow-x: auto;\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:6}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:prt1]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 30, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "{[A,B]}", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "correct: if is(ans1=S) then true else false;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "correct", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["AA", "BB", "S", "a", "b", "c", "d1", "d2", "d3", "d4", "g", "g1", "g2", "h", "k", "temp", "x0", "x1"], "nvariants": 50}